"""Context branches that require different applications within a limited family.

Numerical families already vary displayed inputs. Qualitative structured families
gain a separately marked application; essays and full cases gain a conditional
judgement branch. These are economic differences, not just substituted names.
"""
from economics_author import QUESTIONS, LEDGER, point

# Each triplet is (new evidence, causal interpretation). In structured practice
# the application is worth two marks; in complete papers it informs best fit.
